  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Concern, support to current Humanitarian Situation Concern World Wide</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project with Concern Worldwide is designed to complement and augment the Government led national humanitarian response meeting the needs of conflict impacted populations in Tigray and Amhara regions. Activities include; (1)Meeting the immediate needs of conflict and displacement affected communities through multi-purpose unconditional cash transfers,(2) Enhancing the capacity of health facilities to provide health and nutrition services, (3) Increasing access to Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) services and (4) Increasing access to essential shelter Non Food Items (NFIs).</narrative>
  </description>
